00:13:07.353 --> 00:13:11.357
and square root symbols. And skipping down to the very end,

263
00:13:11.557 --> 00:13:15.361
indeed we have the square root of root two over two.

264
00:13:15.861 --> 00:13:19.498
Well done. This next example has no writing whatsoever.

265
00:13:19.498 --> 00:13:24.003
It's the classic second page inside most IKEA instruction manuals.

266
00:13:24.503 --> 00:13:28.908
So far we've been sending all of our documents to dpt-2-latest.

267
00:13:29.208 --> 00:13:32.211
I'm going to send this one to dpt-1-latest.

268
00:13:32.545 --> 00:13:36.315
This document is exclusively illustrations and figures.

269
00:13:36.682 --> 00:13:39.852
So indeed we have three chunks that are all figures.

270
00:13:40.352 --> 00:13:42.121
Let's focus on this middle figure

271
00:13:42.121 --> 00:13:44.156
and take a look at the markdown.

272
00:13:44.857 --> 00:13:48.160
All right, the final analysis here is that the figure instructs users

